  issues(first: 100, orderBy: updatedAt) {
    nodes {
      id
      identifier
      title
      state { name type }
      issueType { name }
      assignee { name email }
      labels { name }
      blockedBy(first: 10) { nodes { id identifier title } }
    }
  }
}
```

Then filter: issueType.name == "Todo" (or state name is Todo), assignee is Maya Chen, has Bug label, and blockedBy contains "Checkout rollout".

